---
// FooterSection.astro - Pie de página Invitard
---

<footer class="event-footer fade-in-on-scroll">
  <div class="footer-content">
    <!-- Título / Pregunta -->
    <h3 class="footer-question">
      ¿Quieres hacer tus invitaciones para un evento?
    </h3>

    <p class="footer-subtitle">
      Diseñamos invitaciones digitales interactivas, elegantes y memorables para bodas, quinceañeros y eventos especiales.
    </p>

    <!-- Botón WhatsApp de Contacto -->
    <div class="footer-btn-wrapper">
      <a
        href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=51914094578&text=%C2%A1Hola!%20Deseo%20informaci%C3%B3n%20para%20crear%20una%20invitaci%C3%B3n%20para%20mi%20evento."
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="footer-contact-btn"
      >
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path>
        </svg>
        Cont&aacute;ctanos
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-copyright">
      <span>Invitard &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .event-footer {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 35px;
    background-color: #191919;
    border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
    padding: 38px 18px 45px 18px;
    color: #e0e0e0;
    box-shadow: 0 -4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .footer-content {
    max-width: 380px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .footer-question {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 19px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .footer-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: #c0c0c0;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0 auto 22px auto;
    max-width: 320px;
  }

  .footer-btn-wrapper {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .footer-contact-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 12px 30px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    min-height: 46px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(117, 123, 77, 0.4);
    touch-action: manipulation;
  }

  .footer-contact-btn:hover,
  .footer-contact-btn:active {
    background-color: #8E9462;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(117, 123, 77, 0.55);
  }

  .footer-copyright {
    font-family: sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #888888;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
